"- [Updating from mutation responses](https://tanstack.com/query/latest/docs/framework/react/guides/updates-from-mutation-responses) — publishing accepted data into the query cache.\n"
"- [RHF defaultValues](https://react-hook-form.com/docs/useform#defaultValues) — cached defaults and explicit reset."
msgstr "- [TanStack Query Keys](https://tanstack.com/query/latest/docs/framework/react/guides/query-keys) — Identität des Servercaches.\n"
"- [Updates aus Mutation-Antworten](https://tanstack.com/query/latest/docs/framework/react/guides/updates-from-mutation-responses) — bestätigte Daten im Query-Cache veröffentlichen.\n"
